        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Taurus &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>The star cluster on the Bull's shoulder, thrown as points of light.</em></p><p>Make <strong>five</strong> ranged unarmed Strikes against any creatures within 60 feet, each dealing @Damage[1d6[force]] damage plus your key ability modifier.</p><p>Your multiple attack penalty <strong>does not increase</strong> during this activity, but each Strike after the first takes a cumulative <strong>&minus;1</strong> penalty as the light scatters. The activity counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty afterward.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> Each Strike's damage increases by 1d6. At 12th and 18th level, add one Strike, to a maximum of seven.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
